<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67890" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῐνῠθ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μινύθω</span>
			, <i>reduce</i>, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μινυθήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mochl.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			: aor.inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μινυθῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Off.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Liqu.</u>
				1
			</span></i> (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίσαι</span> codd.): pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμινυθήκασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mochl.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; the form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμινύθη</span>, in codd.
			of <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Art.</u>
				53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Off.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, is corrupt for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμινύθεε</span>
			or -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύθει</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
